  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JusticeIsAWeapon.Data.DialogueNodeSO
  nodeId: Interview Thomas
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "The camera shifts to Thomas Webb. He looks like a man vibrating out
    of his skin\u2014sweating, pacing slightly even while seated, and openly hostile.
    He is using his grief as a blunt instrument to keep you both at bay.\r\n\r\n<b>[DEDUCTION
    CLIPBOARD ACTIVE]</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<i>You currently have no physical clues
    to present. Select a baseline topic for Detective Miller to press her on.</i>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Detective
    Miller:</b>\r\n\"He's loud, but he's safe behind a room full of witnesses. Until
    we have paper proving he had a reason to want Marcus dead, pushing him is just
    going to get us a harassment complaint.\"\r\n\r\n<i>[THOMAS WEBB'S STATEMENT
    LOGGED]</i>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r"
  category: 0
  requiredClue: {fileID: 0}
  clueRevealed: {fileID: 0}
  bodyLanguageOverride: 
  isDeadEnd: 0
